note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note apps/si2-live/gate_si2_live.om
note Sovereign Intelligence 2.0 Live End-to-End Integration Gate (`gate_si2_live`).
note Pure seeded OM-2: host tests all 6 SI 2.0 stages, loopback Calls 1/2/3, 5+ negative controls,
note CLI binary checks, AND >= 3 live omc-recompiled source mutants on `apps/si2-live/si2_live_main.om`.
note
note Usage:
note   gate_si2_live <work_dir> <si2_live_bin> <omc_bin> <repo_root>

